# Soccer photo jersey backs (always)

**One silhouette.** Morocco / Spain / Cameroon / PSG cut. Recolor body / collar / cuffs / sides and print the wordmark. Solid `#000` (LED energy). No hanger on photo backs.

**Wordmark:** inner collar, Cameroon arch, ~65% width; two-word names keep the second word on the fabric. Spell IVORY COAST, DR CONGO, MOZAMBIQUE. Tanzania = royal blue + yellow. Ethiopia = green + white collar. Zambia = copper/orange.

**Number overlay:** `#displaySub.soccer-jersey-number` is horizontally center-justified on the jersey midline. Italic numbers stay optically centered (`text-align:center` + `translateX(-0.08em)`). Never left- or right-bias the mark. Apply centering before Pages upload.

## FIX PROMPT — CSS hanger (Image 1) vs named photo (Image 2)

If the LED shows a CSS hanger (colored blocks, hook, CSS country name clipped by the collar) while a named PNG exists, the board took `jersey-css-back`.

Execute:

1. Catalog: `defaultBackgroundUrl` = `soccer-{slug}-back-with-country.png` or `-with-club.png`, `jerseyCssBack: false`.
2. `display-app.js`: a photo URL **wins**. Ignore `jerseyCssBack=1` on the query string when that URL is set. `usePhotoBack = !!jerseyBg`.
3. Gallery / composer: mint `jerseyCssBack=0` whenever a photo URL exists. Never `=1` for photo kits.
4. Ship the PNGs on **`origin/main`** (GitHub Pages). A workspace-only file is not live.
5. Cache-bust `display-app.js` / `jersey-catalog.js` `?v=` on composer/preview pages. Xibo stays `display.html?location=` only.

## LAYOUT — Tanzania lock applied to every named photo kit (QA in silhouette before Pages)

Wordmark at inner collar; name `top` ~36% at 11.2vh; number `top` ~50% at 40.7vh, horizontally center-justified. 96×48 uses those defaults; 64×48 name ~35% / number ~49%; 64×32 name ~34% / number ~48%. Do **not** publish to `origin/main` until every photo kit is checked in the Cameroon/Morocco silhouette (no hanger, number on midline, wordmark under collar).

